msgstr "Impossible de créer la commande."

#: woocommerce-gateway-sezzle.php:1632
#: woocommerce-gateway-sezzle.php:1691
#: woocommerce-gateway-sezzle.php:1727
msgid "Payment approved by Sezzle successfully."
msgstr "Paiement approuvé par Sezzle avec succès."

#: woocommerce-gateway-sezzle.php:1740
msgid "The payment failed because of an unknown error. Please contact Sezzle from the Sezzle merchant dashboard."
msgstr "Le paiement a échoué en raison d’une erreur inconnue. Veuillez contacter Sezzle depuis le tableau de bord marchand Sezzle."

#: woocommerce-gateway-sezzle.php:1768
msgid "An unknown error occurred during payment processing. Please contact Sezzle support."
msgstr "Une erreur inconnue est survenue lors du traitement du paiement. Veuillez contacter l’assistance Sezzle."

#. translators: %s: refund amount, formatted with currency
#: woocommerce-gateway-sezzle.php:1999
#, php-format
msgid "Refund of %s successfully sent to Sezzle."
msgstr "Remboursement de %s envoyé à Sezzle avec succès."

#: woocommerce-gateway-sezzle.php:2026
msgid "There was an error submitting the refund to Sezzle."
msgstr "Une erreur est survenue lors de l’envoi du remboursement à Sezzle."

#: woocommerce-gateway-sezzle.php:2139
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Paramètres"

#: woocommerce-gateway-sezzle.php:3398
msgid "Cart is empty or not available."
msgstr "Le panier est vide ou indisponible."

#: woocommerce-gateway-sezzle.php:3477
msgid "Order created programmatically from cart through express checkout."
msgstr "Commande créée automatiquement à partir du panier via le paiement express."

#: woocommerce-gateway-sezzle.php:3733
#: woocommerce-gateway-sezzle.php:3823
